## Included in this repository

### SAP skills — `.claude/skills/`

    https://sap-ai-skills.com
    Eduard Jiglau <hello@sap-ai-skills.com>
    GPL-3.0

Forty reference skills covering ABAP, SAP BTP, HANA, SAP Analytics Cloud,
SAPUI5, CAP and AI Core. Each carries its own `license:` and `maintainer:` in
its front matter, and each names the SAP documentation it was compiled from.

**One modification**, stated here and in the file itself as GPL-3.0 section 5
requires. `sap-api-style/references/quality-processes.md` contained an example
Stripe key with the `sk_live_` prefix, inside a sample captioned as a security
risk — the lesson being not to hardcode keys. It was replaced with
`sk_live_EXAMPLE_NOT_A_REAL_KEY` on 2026-08-29. GitHub's push protection
blocked the original, correctly: a scanner cannot tell a teaching example from
a leak, and nor can a reader. Nothing else is changed.

`docs/knowledge/sap-landscape.ttl` was written *from* this catalogue rather than
copied out of it: which SAP products exist and how they group is fact, and each
element cites the skill its existence was learned from.

Obtained via the KONE SAP Platform LAB, which vendors the same set. The three
`kspf-*` skills there are specific to that lab and are not included.

### ArchiMate ontology — `ontology/upstream/`

    https://github.com/AlbertoDMendoza/archimate_ontology
    Copyright (c) Alberto D. Mendoza
    Apache-2.0

The machine-readable ArchiMate 3.2 vocabulary and relationship matrix that
`packages/metamodel/src/generated/` is generated from. An unmodified, pinned
copy; full terms in `ontology/upstream/LICENSE`, attribution in
`ontology/NOTICE`.

