## Fetched, not included

### SAP draw.io skill — `vendor/btp-drawio-skill/`

    https://github.com/marianfoo/btp-drawio-skill
    Marian Zeis — plugin code, MIT
    SAP SE or an SAP affiliate — bundled icons and templates, Apache-2.0

Fetched at a pinned commit by `scripts/setup-sap-diagrams.sh`; `vendor/` is
gitignored. Not vendored because the bundle is 20 MB, 16 MB of it SAP reference
templates, and because a copy of an actively maintained upstream goes stale in a
way a pinned fetch does not. Terms in `vendor/NOTICE`.

